    "updated_at": "2017-01-06T22:45:23Z",
    "body": "So the specific conflict in question here is: the `Transfer` abstract op, which is global in the namespace of all abstract ops, and the `[[Transfer]]()` internal method, which is I guess global in the namespace of all internal slots. In the past you've advised us to treat internal slots as IDL attributes. Maybe we should be treating internal methods as IDL methods? Not sure.",
